# What the deployed portal does not need.
#
# The upload was 106MB and failed the file-size limit, almost all of it
# .corpus/corpus.json, the local file-backed validation store. It is
# gitignored, but this deploy does not go through git, so the ignore has
# to be stated here too.

# Local validation corpora
.corpus/
.corpus-verify/

# Build output and dependencies: Vercel builds these itself
.next/
node_modules/
.git/

# Worker-only code. Not imported by anything under app/, and it is the
# code that USES the service-role key. There is no reason for it to exist
# on a server that must never hold that key.
scripts/
supabase/

# Local notes and diagnostics
*.log
docs/
OPEN_SCORING_ISSUES.md
DEPLOYMENT.md
